1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,400
A brave young traveler begins climbing the sacred mountain
at dawn.

2
00:00:04,400 --> 00:00:09,080
She encounters a wise eagle who shares ancient secrets of
courage.

3
00:00:09,080 --> 00:00:13,339
The path becomes steep but her determination grows stronger.

4
00:00:13,339 --> 00:00:17,519
At the summit she discovers a crystal temple glowing with
light.

5
00:00:17,519 --> 00:00:21,539
The temple guardian teaches her the power of inner strength.

6
00:00:21,539 --> 00:00:25,329
She learns that true victory comes from helping others.

7
00:00:25,329 --> 00:00:28,910
With new wisdom she descends to share her knowledge.

8
00:00:28,910 --> 00:00:33,049
The mountain journey transforms her into a guide for others.
